(7392543, 1161496, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the dramatic clouds. Still, this seems like an outtake from the Boats challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition and the dramatic clouds. Still, this seems like an outtake from the Boats challenge.', '2015-07-27 02:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
