(7392546, 1161755, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice. The droplet on the rightmost seedling, where the stem joins the wispy bits, is a little distracting. But other than that it''s a pleasing shot.</td>', 'Nice. The droplet on the rightmost seedling, where the stem joins the wispy bits, is a little distracting. But other than that it''s a pleasing shot.', '2015-07-27 02:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
