(7393298, 1161910, 108069, '<td valign="top">History will look back at this photo and wonder what would have changed had bohemka not gotten caught up in a conversation at rollover and awarded it a silly starecase thing as planned. I''d like to say "we''ll never know," but I think we do know: All is well and nothing has changed. Sigh of relief all around. Great photo.</td>', 'History will look back at this photo and wonder what would have changed had bohemka not gotten caught up in a conversation at rollover and awarded it a silly starecase thing as planned. I''d like to say "we''ll never know," but I think we do know: All is well and nothing has changed. Sigh of relief all around. Great photo.', '2015-07-29 01:19:21.000000', NULL, 0),
