(7393369, 1161629, 151548, '<td valign="top">Thank you dtremain - my first award. It''s not an ironic one is it? I put it on my bio.<br/>Who gave the 3 ? - there''s always one isn''t there? Do they learn when they see themselves out of step.<br/>Thank you for the tens and both comments.<br/>This was my strongest edit as the photo used made up quite a small part of the frame but colour changes were marginal use of curves.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-07-29 14:12:06.</i></td>', 'Thank you dtremain - my first award. It''s not an ironic one is it? I put it on my bio.Who gave the 3 ? - there''s always one isn''t there? Do they learn when they see themselves out of step.Thank you for the tens and both comments.This was my strongest edit as the photo used made up quite a small part of the frame but colour changes were marginal use of curves.', '2015-07-29 06:06:44.000000', '2015-07-29 15:12:06.000000', 0),
(7393372, 1162055, 80831, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed this didn''t get a 7...just goes to show you how much scores are affected during the DPL...congrats!</td>', 'I''m amazed this didn''t get a 7...just goes to show you how much scores are affected during the DPL...congrats!', '2015-07-29 06:23:44.000000', NULL, 0),
