(7393707, 1161847, 38032, '<td valign="top">Letting what would seem like so much light into the camera yet the sunlit area is perfectly exposed is quite a trick. The humans are transient and temporary but the wall will stick around much longer. Mere mortals swimming on a rock of virtual permanence. Very glad to see this since I never got around to voting on all the images. Very spleen-worthy etc.</td>', 'Letting what would seem like so much light into the camera yet the sunlit area is perfectly exposed is quite a trick. The humans are transient and temporary but the wall will stick around much longer. Mere mortals swimming on a rock of virtual permanence. Very glad to see this since I never got around to voting on all the images. Very spleen-worthy etc.', '2015-07-30 09:11:14.000000', NULL, 0),
