(7394678, 1161852, 16912, '<td valign="top">Ha, this would have been my idea for the Golden Hour challenge but it would have been with a decent dram ;)<br/> <br/>I hope the weather forecast is as bad for you as it is for me this week but wish you the best of luck in our DPL 2015 playoff match.</td>', 'Ha, this would have been my idea for the Golden Hour challenge but it would have been with a decent dram ;) I hope the weather forecast is as bad for you as it is for me this week but wish you the best of luck in our DPL 2015 playoff match.', '2015-08-03 11:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
