(7394813, 1161209, 29011, '<td valign="top">How fun! really like the unique composition and point of view. A big fan of waterproofing cameras ;) So very cool.</td>', 'How fun! really like the unique composition and point of view. A big fan of waterproofing cameras ;) So very cool.', '2015-08-03 22:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7395197, 1161930, 25024, '<td valign="top">*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club*<br/> <br/>A confusing image that probably meets the challenge in a challenging way<br/> <br/>I''m not entirely convinced that what I am looking at is in fact liquid, it is an interesting interpretation but not entirely successful given the low score but your commenters are certainly impressed by it. Given your title I assume what we are meant to believe we are looking at is a diver diving through water to the seabed in search of pearls? What I think I am actually looking at is a dog running across the ground?<br/> <br/>I do like the abstract nature of your image and I like the motion blur and I like that it is not an obvious straightforward shot of water in a bowl or similar, it makes you question what you are looking at which has to be a good thing, it is stimulating.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your submission, Sid</td>', '*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club* A confusing image that probably meets the challenge in a challenging way I''m not entirely convinced that what I am looking at is in fact liquid, it is an interesting interpretation but not entirely successful given the low score but your commenters are certainly impressed by it. Given your title I assume what we are meant to believe we are looking at is a diver diving through water to the seabed in search of pearls? What I think I am actually looking at is a dog running across the ground? I do like the abstract nature of your image and I like the motion blur and I like that it is not an obvious straightforward shot of water in a bowl or similar, it makes you question what you are looking at which has to be a good thing, it is stimulating. Thanks for your submission, Sid', '2015-08-05 08:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7395200, 1162068, 179675, '<td valign="top">Stellar shot, Scott. It looks to be a slow shutter speed, yet you have exquisite detail of the drops on the side. Details please sir.</td>', 'Stellar shot, Scott. It looks to be a slow shutter speed, yet you have exquisite detail of the drops on the side. Details please sir.', '2015-08-05 08:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7397021, 1161911, 29011, '<td valign="top">A very nicely captured image. Would fit the NY Times Food section in style and quality. A cool setup, if not a setup then kudos for making this look so good in the drink''s natural environment. Maybe it would''ve scored higher if the orange wasn''t eaten. On the other hand, it adds some humanity.</td>', 'A very nicely captured image. Would fit the NY Times Food section in style and quality. A cool setup, if not a setup then kudos for making this look so good in the drink''s natural environment. Maybe it would''ve scored higher if the orange wasn''t eaten. On the other hand, it adds some humanity.', '2015-08-12 14:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7397303, 1161640, 98565, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and sharpness. Would have rated this picture higher, I was one of your 7</td>', 'Love the colors and sharpness. Would have rated this picture higher, I was one of your 7', '2015-08-13 20:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7399514, 1161683, 136989, '<td valign="top">Love the vivid colors and contrast. Way cool!</td>', 'Love the vivid colors and contrast. Way cool!', '2015-08-24 01:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
